<title>POLAND: PEKPOL JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>PEKPOL JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.19 vs   0.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.14 vs   0.03</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.02 vs   0.04</p>
<p> Sales		   18.02 vs  17.80</p>
