<p> Net profit	     0.21 vs   1.90</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.29 vs   2.78</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.04 vs   0.58</p>
<p> Sales		  110.51 vs 113.13</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food producer is Pekpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
